smoking-puff-unlit = You need to light {THE($item)} first!
smoking-puff-empty = {CAPITALIZE(THE($item))} is completely empty!
smoking-mouth-blocked = Your mouth is covered or occupied!
smoking-puff-start-self = You take a drag from {THE($item)}...
smoking-puff-start-target = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} holds {THE($item)} to your lips...
smoking-puff-start-user = You hold {THE($item)} to {THE($target)}'s lips...
smoking-puff-success-self = You take a deep puff from {THE($item)} and exhale a cloud of smoke.
smoking-puff-success-other = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} lets {THE($target)} take a drag from {THE($item)}, exhaling smoke.
smoking-puff-smoke-ring = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} takes a smooth drag and blows an impressive smoke ring!
smoking-puff-burnt-out = {CAPITALIZE(THE($item))} has burnt out completely.
smoking-light-from-other = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} lights {THE($target)} with {THE($used)}.
smoking-puff-choke = You choke on the dense smoke from rapid puffs and cough violently!

# Nicotine addiction and withdrawal
smoking-addiction-formed = You feel like nicotine has become part of your daily routine... You are now addicted to smoking.
smoking-withdrawal-relief = You take a long-awaited drag... Your mind clears up and the nicotine withdrawal fades.
smoking-addiction-cured = The medicine cleanses your body and completely cures your nicotine addiction!
smoking-craving-1 = Your hands tremble slightly. You desperately crave a cigarette...
smoking-craving-2 = Your fingers search for a cigarette. Your throat tingles with the urge to smoke!
smoking-craving-3 = A persistent urge to smoke pulses in your head. It's time for a smoke break...

# Mood effects
mood-effect-NicotineSatisfied = You feel a pleasant nicotine relaxation.
mood-effect-NicotineWithdrawal = Withdrawal! You desperately need a cigarette, and your hands are shaking.
